#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0176 expect=skipped domain=ADAE
#note "structure=OCCDS is the DECLARED tier and beats the column heuristic (Fix #154), so the dataset's structure is OCCURRENCE DATA STRUCTURE, which is not in Scope.Data_Structures (BDS / MEDICAL DEVICE BDS) - the rule is out of scope and never runs. ABLFL=N on the row is data that would fire if it did, which is what makes the skip assertion non-vacuous. The mandatory #library line is the carrier for the declaration."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADAE structure=OCCDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AEDECOD type=Char
col ABLFL   type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEADACHE | N
